       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose is well above the usual limits for ibuprofen:\n\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily adds up to **6400 mg/day**. That's twice the usual maximum prescription dose of 3200 mg/day. At that level, the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury and heart problems goes up a lot, even in a patient with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nThis could be a mix-up between the daily total and the per-dose amount. If 1600 mg is meant to be the **total for the day**, that would be **400 mg four times daily**.\n\nWhich do you want?\n1. **Ibuprofen 400 mg PO four times daily** (1600 mg/day)\n2. **Ibuprofen 800 mg PO three or four times daily** (2400\u20133200 mg/day, the high end of the usual range)\n3. **Another dose.** If you do want 1600 mg four times daily on purpose, please confirm and give the reason, and I'll add it to the order note.\n\nAs soon as you confirm, I'll enter the order."
